        "TileImage": "$($repository f5f5028c-6974-46d9-a76d-594398124b1f).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon 47. Your targets are Clem Milburn, Marty Will Patrick, and Timmothy Aisle.  All three are pit crew, but they are actually all working for the same company. This company is just like the one from earlier in Italy. Which seems to be part of a larger web of businesses using the same cheap parts!\r\rAnd now, they are working on the Global Innovation Race!\r\rThese three are their best &quot;Technicians&quot;, and their most deadly.\rStop them before its too late.\r\rGood luck, 47.",
